{"toolCallId":"call_8d7cf2ed672542299c444b21c7f6450f","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n- Level 3: Should have protocol section (warning if missing)\n- Level 3+: Must have at least 3/4 components (error if fewer)\n- Phase parent: skipped. Under the lean trio policy its `plan.md` and `tasks.md` live in the child folders, which carry the protocol.\n\n### Detection Patterns\n\n```markdown\n## AI EXECUTION PROTOCOL         ← Main section\n### Pre-Task Checklist           ← Component 1\n### Execution Rules              ← Component 2\n### Status Reporting Format      ← Component 3\n### Blocked Task Protocol        ← Component 4\n```\n\n### Examples\n\n**Pass (Level 3+):**\n```markdown\n## AI EXECUTION PROTOCOL\n\n### Pre-Task Checklist\n- [ ] Read relevant files\n- [ ] Verify preconditions\n\n### Execution Rules\n| Rule | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| TASK-SEQ | Complete tasks in order |\n| TASK-SCOPE | Only modify files in scope |\n\n### Status Reporting Format\nAfter each task: \"Task T## complete. Files modified: [list]\"\n\n### Blocked Task Protocol\nIf blocked: Stop, document blocker, request help\n```\n\n### How to Fix\n\nAdd the AI Execution Protocol section to plan.md or tasks.md. Reference the Level 3 templates:\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w27ef8e22cd/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"5a2488","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
